      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Agentic trajectories carry prior context across repeated model and tool calls, in some cases processing up to 3 million tokens, so each request’s working memory grows over time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/memory-full-stack-codesign/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.834Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "More HBM can hold more KV cache and support more concurrent users.",
