      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Recent models, including FLUX.2 [klein] from Black Forest Labs , Inkling from Thinking Machines Lab, Beam 1.0 from Reflection , Meta Muse Spark from Meta , Step 5 Preview from StepFun and NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL have been released with NVFP4 checkpoints, demonstrating gro…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/memory-full-stack-codesign/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.834Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Within an NVL72 system, model weights can be distributed across up to 72 GPUs , so each GPU holds a smaller share of the model — leaving more HBM for KV cache and concurrent users.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/memory-full-stack-codesign/",
